# A book no library has free. The offer is a hold instead of a borrow, and
# placing one is the same single tap as borrowing: choosing the library is the
# decision, and the progress is drawn on the book.
clean
tap Qui va séduire Henry ?
wait-for Book details
expect Montréal · Reserve
expect BAnQ · Reserve
expect Place a hold
expect-missing Borrow & send
clean
tap Montréal
wait-for Waiting to start
expect Book details
clean
wait-for You are in line at Montréal
expect Your holds are in Library
clean
tap Open Library
wait-for My books
expect Waiting for your turn
